  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Some nuclei of a radioactive material are undergoing radioactive decay. The time gap between the instances when a quarter of the nuclei have decayed and when half of the nuclei have decayed is given as: (where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is the decay constant)</p>",
